.TH GLISSANDO-VOICE 1 "" "glissando" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
glissando\-voice \- local speech recognition helper of the glissando keyboard
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B glissando\-voice
[\fIOPTIONS\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B glissando\-voice
records the microphone and transcribes it on the device with whisper.cpp.
\fBglissando\fR(1) starts it and talks to it over its standard input and
output, so it is not meant to be run by hand. Audio never leaves the device.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BI \-\-lang " CODE"
Language of the speech.
.TP
.BI \-\-model " FILE"
Speech model.
.TP
.BI \-\-engine " FILE"
The whisper\-cli executable.
.TP
.BI \-\-max\-seconds " N"
Longest recording; the default is 30.
.TP
.BI \-\-threads " N"
Transcription threads; the default is 4.
.TP
.BI \-\-input " COMMAND"
Program that writes the recording to its standard output.
.TP
.B \-\-check
Report whether voice typing can run.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR glissando (1)
